{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f92b99248c8c2b75af7c31aeb02b9e08d6c25886257b9a93291ff73925f12368", "ja": "（確かにこの間のフェスではだいぶ頑張って\nくれたもんな。少しはのんびりさせてあげたいが……）", "zh": "（确实，之前的庆典上她也非常努力。虽然想让她稍微放松一下，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "2b53d7be4b5388581ca3c85b0c8dcecb9f7ff4ef46847b1e2c60495aa004b613", "ja": "やん♪　ハニー、そこはダメなの……♡", "zh": "呀♪亲爱的，那里不行啦……♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9d47e897006f4f494446f70b9002e77713af1f7d5cf32c138c6a7f33ae1139c4", "ja": "やっぱり起こそう。美希？　美希ー？\n悪いんだけどちょっといいかー？", "zh": "还是把她叫醒吧。美希？美希——？\n不好意思，能醒一会儿吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "ee874caa5c11bf65bc646bb5dbcc2346140e3e5b92e5f25df4ad11e1e9edabca", "ja": "あふぅ。おはよ、ハニー。\nあのね、ミキ、まだちょっと眠いかも……。", "zh": "哈啊。早呀，Honey。\n那个呀，美希好像还是有点困……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2785f3af8f06d1ba4325e4dcdb09288205ca79e7123e7eb2c8881e2fc2250b00", "ja": "疲れがたまってるんだろう。本当にお疲れさま。\nでも、ちょっとだけ頑張って聞いてくれないか？", "zh": "你应该是累积了不少疲劳吧。真的辛苦了。\n不过，能不能再稍微打起精神听我说一会儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "a106b46dfdaa8cb72e4aafd49f8f1d39722890d8ebfa05aca856e28ef0bfe8c9", "ja": "むー。じゃあミキのこと、膝枕してくれる？\nそしたら、ゆっくりお話が聞けるって思うな……。", "zh": "唔——那能给美希膝枕吗？\n那样的话，美希觉得就能好好听你说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1010_p", "source_sha256": "edeb167b8c27ff2958eafa3a0a19e9c7ca775ccf0577833ae7ab0cda8167f927", "ja": "いや、このままで。ウォーターベッドのメーカーから、\nオファーが来てるんだ。", "zh": "不，就这样吧。有家水床制造商\n发来了工作邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "53df524375093db0c36b53c72340fd5371bb182922330a15a137f9315df8f1bd", "ja": "え？　ウォーターベッドって、あの\nタプタプしてて気持ちいいベッド？", "zh": "诶？水床就是那种软乎乎、躺起来很舒服的床吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6e261638354799954464b7aefa1bca51731a33135f3abded81cc920f540d0425", "ja": "ああ、そのベッドだ。マットレスの中に水が入ってて、\nそれはもう気持ちよく、ゆっくり眠れるらしい。", "zh": "啊，就是那种床。听说床垫里装着水，睡起来特别舒服，能让人慢慢地睡个好觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1013_p", "source_sha256": "36eb33393220f47b28f53ca1303fb69ae61e916ccd4846791ab054589e1a2926", "ja": "その新商品のキャンペーンガールの依頼が来てる。\n美希にぴったりの仕事じゃないか？", "zh": "有个邀请，请美希担任那款新商品的宣传女孩。不是很适合美希的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "436b4c01fbcae8b2227418319a87f91824380b4ec8254e97a020ece47d85c064", "ja": "うん、ピッタリってカンジ！\nミキ、気持ちよく眠ることには自信あるし♪", "zh": "嗯，感觉简直太合适了！\n美希对让自己舒舒服服地睡觉可是很有自信的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cf037529e545473555bea3e5aa64fa351c3707fc1488c7f22d943377f265b2d5", "ja": "そうだよな。よし、じゃあこの仕事は受ける方向で。\n早速先方に伝えておくよ。", "zh": "就是说啊。好，那这份工作就接下来了。\n我这就去跟对方说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "c3c3d356ab5b54e91d92f2c1c1961a69ebd5db96f1709457179cfe5fa030cd5b", "ja": "伝えて伝えて♪　いっぱいお昼寝させて\nもらえるように、ミキ、がんばるね。", "zh": "快去说快去说♪为了能让我多睡一会儿，美希会加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0533_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "2bdae93e91534ca92902732f53abda929697bddebd305aea6baf4d22f11ad149", "ja": "それじゃ、ベッドのお仕事のリハーサルで～。\n……お休みなさいなの～。……あふぅ。", "zh": "那么，就来彩排一下床铺的工作吧～。\n……晚安咯～……哈呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
